# Gemini API Configuration
# This file is a template. Copy to `.env` and fill in your own key.
#
# SECURITY WARNING:
# The variable name below is read by `vite.config.ts` and its value is
# inlined into the browser bundle at build time. That means ANY value
# placed in `.env` becomes PUBLIC to every user of the deployed app.
#
# This project is intended for LOCAL / PRIVATE prototyping only.
# For any public deployment, move the Gemini call behind a server-side
# proxy or serverless function and load the real key from server
# environment variables / secrets. Do NOT commit a real key to `.env`.
#
# Get a key (restricted, low-quota recommended) from:
#   https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# Optional: API endpoint override (for testing/custom endpoints).
# Not yet wired in vite.config.ts; included for future use.
# GEMINI_API_BASE_URL=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com

# Optional: Enable debug logging (true/false). Off by default.
# GEMINI_DEBUG=false
